{"unit_id":"RyensX__dsh-message-fold#card-1","repo":"RyensX/dsh-message-fold","commit":"b40619079758a949a73c6c91507a14a07d72d8b0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-fold 为 DSH Web 会话提供消息折叠。插件装饰会话消息 renderer，把一轮中的中间活动及连续工具调用整理成可展开摘要，并显示耗时、工具类别和失败数量。模型准备调用工具、正式工具行出现前，也会显示准备提示；设置页可单独关闭该提示。适合希望减少长会话界面占用、又能按需查看过程的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:22-76","src/client/components/create-decorated-renderer.tsx:156-198","src/client/presentation/tool-summary.ts:44-95","src/client/components/MessageFoldSettingsSection.tsx:41-82"]}
